    "body": "## Problem\n\nSource-style terminfo escapes such as `\\033` and `\\177` are converted as decimal numbers, producing incorrect bytes. The unbounded digit match can also consume following text or pass an out-of-range value to `string.char`.\n\n## Solution\n\nDecode three octal digits with base 8. Extend the existing TermResponse channel test to check that `\\177` decodes to `DEL`.",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-18T23:21:11Z",
